	<content contentuid="he9f32d68g0b86g493eg880dgad8d06bc29d7" version="1">Hellbrand</content>
	<content contentuid="hc7f0d3dcg8f9ag4b8fg983egf778ffb2db10" version="1">When you deal&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; to a target affected by &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING_HELLFIRE"&gt;Hellfire&lt;/LSTag&gt;, it also gains &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_Ring43_Status_1"&gt;Devilfire&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>
	<content contentuid="h54e8320ag9e57g4053gaca3g5cf956562df2" version="1">When you deal&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; to a target affected by &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING_HELLFIRE"&gt;Hellfire&lt;/LSTag&gt;, it also gains &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_Ring43_4_Status_1"&gt;Devilfire&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>
	<content contentuid="h6498381bg068ag4b87g91a8g4bca525ca940" version="1">Hellish Forge</content>
	<content contentuid="h31b4c4e6g39e6g49a1ga9a8ge0d6fd14f69f" version="1">Forged from infernal metal, this ring lets you cast &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="MAG_Ring43_4_scorchingVolley"&gt;Scorching Volley&lt;/LSTag&gt; and reduces all incoming&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; by &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
