	<content contentuid="hc48051c4g9c9fg4df8g9cbcg760563dc63d0" version="1">The affected entity becomes &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;Vulnerable&lt;/LSTag&gt; to&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
